WEBVTT

00:01.320 --> 00:02.510
Mother...

00:02.670 --> 00:05.910
Harvey suggested that I should
make an ad in the newspaper

00:05.940 --> 00:08.410
so that I can find my brooch,

00:08.650 --> 00:12.600
but in the meantime
the Black Rose gave it back to me.

00:13.550 --> 00:17.130
And now, I'm finally going to Vienna!

00:25.850 --> 00:27.100
NAAJA

00:25.850 --> 00:27.100
Nadja,

00:27.270 --> 00:29.770
With your eyes

00:27.270 --> 00:29.770
Kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:29.770 --> 00:30.980
Nadja,

00:29.770 --> 00:30.980
NAAJA

00:30.980 --> 00:33.240
What do you see?

00:30.980 --> 00:33.240
Nani ga mieru

00:33.320 --> 00:36.150
Shining in the far distance,

00:33.320 --> 00:36.150
Haruka tooku hikaru

00:36.150 --> 00:38.570
The door to the future,

00:36.150 --> 00:38.570
Mirai no tobira

00:39.530 --> 00:42.950
That's what I'm searching for

00:39.530 --> 00:42.950
Sagashite iru

00:42.950 --> 00:50.210
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:50.840 --> 00:54.420
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:50.840 --> 00:54.420
Minna egao de aetara

00:54.420 --> 00:57.680
I'm sure there would be no more fighting

00:54.420 --> 00:57.680
Arasoi mo kitto nakunaru

00:57.800 --> 01:01.010
It could be so much more fun

00:57.800 --> 01:01.010
Konna ni mo tanoshi kunaru

01:01.010 --> 01:04.430
The world is wide, but it's still one

01:01.010 --> 01:04.430
Sekai wa hiroi kedo hitotsu ne

01:04.810 --> 01:08.100
I can't see the end of the journey

01:04.810 --> 01:08.100
Tabi no owari wa mienai

01:08.230 --> 01:11.520
God is the only one who could possibly know

01:08.230 --> 01:11.520
Kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:11.730 --> 01:15.360
To the people who, someday, I will meet again

01:11.730 --> 01:15.360
Itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:15.400 --> 01:17.450
I will go waving

01:15.400 --> 01:17.450
Te wo furinagara

01:17.610 --> 01:24.200
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:17.610 --> 01:24.200
Toki ni wa BURUU ni naru hi mo aru kedo

01:24.240 --> 01:26.960
But I won't look back

01:24.240 --> 01:26.960
Ushiro mukanai

01:27.370 --> 01:32.250
Until the day my dream comes true

01:27.370 --> 01:32.250
Yume ga kanau hi made

01:32.540 --> 01:35.960
Nadja, Your smile

01:32.540 --> 01:35.960
NAAJA kimi no hohoemi wa

01:36.130 --> 01:39.380
Nadja, gives me courage

01:36.130 --> 01:39.380
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:39.430 --> 01:42.350
Under the blue sky,

01:39.430 --> 01:42.350
Aoi sora no shita de

01:42.510 --> 01:45.390
I will find the place

01:42.510 --> 01:45.390
Ashita no yukue

01:45.680 --> 01:49.600
where my future lies

01:45.680 --> 01:49.600
Mitsukeru kara

02:10.420 --> 02:11.080
﻿Mother...

02:12.540 --> 02:13.710
﻿I've come...

02:16.840 --> 02:19.220
﻿to the city you're in - Vienna!

02:22.340 --> 02:25.720
﻿This time, I'm going to find Mother for sure...

02:25.970 --> 02:27.220
﻿That Herman...

02:27.680 --> 02:29.430
﻿What is he playing at?!

02:29.940 --> 02:33.860
﻿I told him to keep everything about Nadja a secret!

02:38.900 --> 02:44.830
﻿There's no way Father wouldn't admit you now!

02:48.410 --> 02:55.000
﻿The Black Rose steals Nadja's - the previously-separated granddaughter of Duke Preminger- brooch?

02:55.290 --> 02:57.300
﻿What's wrong with this thing?!

02:57.300 --> 02:59.510
﻿The story's completely different!

03:00.920 --> 03:02.300
﻿Why did it turn out like this?

03:07.970 --> 03:12.850
Rosemary -- The Scheme Behind the Smile

03:13.940 --> 03:16.360
﻿That Harvey! Did he make a mistake?

03:16.900 --> 03:20.440
﻿We told him that the ones who stole the brooch are "Rosso" and "Bianco"...!

03:20.780 --> 03:23.110
﻿Why does it say that The Black Rose stole it?

03:25.280 --> 03:26.240
﻿The Black Rose...

03:28.370 --> 03:33.210
﻿Indeed...it was The Black Rose who got it back for me, but..

03:34.170 --> 03:37.380
﻿There might've been some misunderstanding...

03:37.380 --> 03:41.880
﻿Yeah... I know Harvey wouldn't make a mistake in the least...

03:42.380 --> 03:44.890
﻿"The Black Rose was the one who stole the brooch"...

03:47.050 --> 03:51.430
﻿Nadja, did The Black Rose get the brooch back for you?

03:53.690 --> 03:57.520
﻿Kennosuke, you promised not to ask that.

03:57.770 --> 03:58.360
﻿Oops...!

03:58.610 --> 03:59.110
﻿Slap!

03:59.570 --> 04:00.480
﻿Sorry...

04:00.900 --> 04:05.950
﻿Is it possible to think that the people in the photograph are related to this?

04:06.320 --> 04:11.040
The granddaughter is called 'Nadja'."...

04:11.200 --> 04:14.250
﻿there's no way such a coincidence would exist, right?

04:14.370 --> 04:17.330
﻿So that means...Nadja is the granddaughter of Duke Preminger?!

04:17.880 --> 04:19.290
﻿You think...?

04:20.460 --> 04:21.800
﻿Then who's this girl?

04:22.210 --> 04:25.630
﻿Yeah! Wearing the same clothes as Nadja

04:26.930 --> 04:31.100
﻿The fact that the brooch was stolen before doesn't seem to be irrelevant to this.

04:32.270 --> 04:35.140
﻿Someone's trying to replace me...

04:36.850 --> 04:38.270
﻿I can't take this anymore!

04:38.270 --> 04:43.030
﻿Let's go to the House of Preminger and tell them that this is the real Nadja!

04:43.440 --> 04:44.690
﻿Yeah! Let's!

04:45.150 --> 04:47.200
﻿Actually, We'd better not...

04:47.360 --> 04:48.370
﻿Why!?

04:48.820 --> 04:51.700
﻿If it's on the newspaper this big...

04:51.740 --> 04:52.950
﻿If?

04:53.040 --> 04:55.290
﻿Even if we suddenly barge into their place,

04:55.290 --> 04:58.460
﻿our Nadja will be considered "the fake", for sure.

04:58.880 --> 04:59.750
﻿No way!

05:01.960 --> 05:07.180
﻿Hm... I know how you feel, but it's better to take things prudently here.

05:09.340 --> 05:12.970
﻿If I was really the granddaughter of the Duke Preminger.

05:13.970 --> 05:15.770
﻿my mother should be around nearby.

05:19.190 --> 05:21.230
﻿There's no way other than to find the girl in the photograph.

05:21.980 --> 05:24.070
﻿Then I know a good way.

05:24.440 --> 05:25.240
What?

05:27.030 --> 05:28.610
﻿Over here, Nadja.

05:29.110 --> 05:31.280
﻿Can you really find some information here?

05:32.450 --> 05:33.330
﻿Oh yes, probably.

05:34.290 --> 05:39.330
﻿Just what I expected from Anna Petrova! All of them are so beautiful it makes me wonder which one to choose...!

05:39.540 --> 05:47.380
﻿I'd love to buy all of them, but my husband is an economist and he fusses about me using money, even on one single handkerchief!

05:47.760 --> 05:57.850
﻿Oh. yes Talking about fussing... recently, a relation of Duke Kreisky's been engaged, but the wife who belongs to the House of Schnabel is fussy about coffee.

05:57.890 --> 06:04.440
﻿and she fusses about such things as the temperature of the milk foam or the chocolates that come with it!

06:04.610 --> 06:11.950
﻿And the other day she had a huge quarrel with the Duchess of Kreisky... There's been a rumor that the engagement's about to break...

06:11.950 --> 06:14.080
﻿Words fail me!

06:14.240 --> 06:15.450
﻿That reminds me..

06:16.950 --> 06:21.420
﻿I've heard that the granddaughter of the Duke Preminger has appeared...

06:21.540 --> 06:23.590
﻿Oh yes... You like gossiping too...

06:24.090 --> 06:25.960
﻿don't you Anna?

06:26.300 --> 06:31.130
﻿Until I read the newspaper, I knew nothing about it!

06:31.380 --> 06:35.350
﻿There's a rumor that the Duke Preminger was hiding that on purpose...

06:35.510 --> 06:39.390
﻿Apparently, she's going to make an appearance tonight.

06:41.600 --> 06:43.190
﻿Uh... I'm sorry!

06:43.650 --> 06:45.520
﻿Tonight, did you say?!

06:45.520 --> 06:52.070
﻿Yes indeed! It's said that she's going to party held at the mansion of the Viscount of Strohein...!

06:52.410 --> 06:54.070
﻿Wow...!

06:55.780 --> 06:57.490
﻿The viscount of Strohein...

07:12.680 --> 07:15.970
﻿Tonight is going to be a wonderful night...

07:16.640 --> 07:19.430
﻿Rosemary, no, Nadja.

07:20.140 --> 07:25.020
﻿The party tonight is to show the society that...

07:25.020 --> 07:28.440
﻿you're the granddaughter of Duke Preminger.

07:28.820 --> 07:31.280
﻿Don't forget that.

07:36.320 --> 07:39.040
﻿No need to worry, Uncle Herman.

07:39.580 --> 07:43.870
﻿It takes one look at me to notice..

07:44.830 --> 07:48.210
﻿that I'm a natural princess.

07:50.920 --> 07:53.130
﻿Are you really going to the party?

07:54.840 --> 07:57.140
﻿I want to see it for myself, no matter what.

07:57.850 --> 08:00.470
﻿How are you going to attend the party?

08:00.470 --> 08:03.270
﻿You're not invited, right?

08:03.270 --> 08:05.230
﻿And it's dangerous on your own.

08:07.810 --> 08:08.570
﻿It's going to be all right!

08:08.860 --> 08:10.650
﻿It's less noticeable if I'm on my own...

08:10.900 --> 08:14.610
﻿and even if they won't let me in from the entrance, I have a way!

08:39.510 --> 08:41.220
﻿Thank you...

08:49.610 --> 08:52.030
﻿Everyone is looking at me...

08:52.030 --> 08:53.490
﻿Me...

09:12.670 --> 09:14.420
﻿I got in somehow...

09:22.720 --> 09:29.350
Good evening, It is an honor to be invited here tonight, Duchess Strohein.

09:29.600 --> 09:33.070
﻿It is a pleasure to meet you. l am Nadja Preminger.

09:34.980 --> 09:38.610
﻿So you're the granddaughter of Duke Preminger.

09:39.110 --> 09:39.820
﻿Yes.

09:42.530 --> 09:44.450
﻿What a wonderful lady you are!

09:44.450 --> 09:46.040
﻿Thank you.

09:50.880 --> 09:52.540
﻿I need to find her.

10:02.140 --> 10:06.560
﻿The granddaughter of Duke Preminger is pretty indeed!

10:07.680 --> 10:12.060
Did you see Lady Nadja's amazing platinum blond hair? I'm so jealous!

10:12.520 --> 10:15.190
﻿The duke must be very happy.

10:16.190 --> 10:18.190
﻿So she's here

10:18.610 --> 10:20.320
﻿the girl who's pretending to be me!

10:23.530 --> 10:25.240
﻿Who are you?

10:25.620 --> 10:27.040
﻿Why are you doing such a thing like this?

10:30.870 --> 10:34.250
﻿Nadja's now Father's favorite.

10:34.250 --> 10:35.590
﻿Oh really.

10:37.920 --> 10:40.970
﻿You should see how much he cherishes her...!

10:40.970 --> 10:43.800
﻿Oh, the Duke does?

10:45.560 --> 10:46.510
﻿I've found you.

10:58.650 --> 11:00.360
﻿I can't get closer to her in this...

11:00.950 --> 11:02.070
﻿Excuse me.

11:03.360 --> 11:05.240
﻿Would you please dance with me?

11:06.280 --> 11:08.240
﻿Err... um...

11:09.750 --> 11:12.120
﻿Perhaps I could get closer to her by dancing...

11:20.630 --> 11:24.510
﻿Really? You haven't met your mother yet?

11:28.560 --> 11:32.270
﻿Yes... she's been abroad and hasn't come back yet...

11:36.980 --> 11:41.530
﻿But I get to meet her soon. Right, Uncle?

11:42.360 --> 11:43.570
﻿Rosemary...!

12:20.730 --> 12:21.940
﻿Rosemary...

12:22.190 --> 12:24.150
﻿why are you here?

12:24.860 --> 12:27.660
﻿Why are you being called my name?

12:45.430 --> 12:46.130
﻿Nadja!

12:47.300 --> 12:49.010
﻿Why is Nadja here...?

12:52.430 --> 12:53.520
The brooch too, even.

12:56.690 --> 12:59.730
﻿Why don't we go for a little chat over there?

13:05.240 --> 13:06.820
﻿Yes. let's.

13:12.490 --> 13:13.290
﻿Nadja.

13:14.910 --> 13:16.120
What?

13:16.410 --> 13:18.790
﻿Why does that girl have that brooch?

13:19.210 --> 13:22.210
﻿And... is that dress Collette's?

13:22.710 --> 13:28.090
﻿No, more than that... she looks like Gillette when she was young...

13:28.380 --> 13:31.470
Could this girl be the real Nadja?

13:32.060 --> 13:34.430
﻿It's alright, Uncle Herman.

13:35.560 --> 13:36.480
Herman?

13:37.100 --> 13:40.360
﻿If you meet a man called Herman, be careful.

13:41.480 --> 13:42.820
﻿So that man's Herman..

13:49.320 --> 13:52.280
﻿That Rosemary, what is she playing at?

13:53.490 --> 13:54.410
﻿Get in.

13:56.790 --> 13:58.920
﻿Rosemary, why are you...

13:59.080 --> 14:01.080
﻿Sorry Nadja...

14:02.380 --> 14:03.750
﻿sorry...

14:04.800 --> 14:05.550
I...

14:06.260 --> 14:08.510
﻿I didn't want to do this...

14:10.340 --> 14:11.390
﻿Rosemary.

14:12.390 --> 14:14.010
﻿Forgive me Nadja.

14:14.600 --> 14:17.430
﻿Tell me what happened.

14:19.100 --> 14:24.820
﻿You remember that I used to work at Fernando's mansion in Granada, Spain?

14:26.280 --> 14:29.820
﻿When I said that I was loved by everyone in that mansion...

14:30.150 --> 14:31.530
﻿That was a lie.

14:34.030 --> 14:36.080
﻿So it was like that after all.

14:36.910 --> 14:41.830
﻿Everyday I'd be teased by Fernando and the elder maids...

14:42.670 --> 14:48.260
﻿I worked so hard, but no one helped me...

14:49.260 --> 14:53.930
﻿And in the end...l was kicked out of the mansion...

14:57.060 --> 14:59.890
﻿I didn't know you were troubled with such things like that...

15:01.190 --> 15:03.100
﻿It must've been hard for you.

15:04.020 --> 15:07.360
﻿I'm sorry I didn't realize that time...

15:09.190 --> 15:13.320
﻿Gullible Nadja...can't you see it's all a lie?

15:14.780 --> 15:21.210
﻿It was hard...I had no money, I was hungry, and I even had no place to sleep.

15:22.370 --> 15:25.920
﻿And then, that man appeared.

15:26.500 --> 15:27.500
﻿That Herman...

15:28.300 --> 15:30.720
﻿Herman's that man just then, isn't he?

15:31.630 --> 15:32.880
﻿Nadja. that hurts...

15:33.680 --> 15:35.050
﻿Oh, sorry..

15:36.350 --> 15:40.180
﻿Herman's Duke Preminger's son.

15:40.730 --> 15:42.520
﻿Your mother's younger brother..

15:42.520 --> 15:43.350
﻿My mother?!

15:44.850 --> 15:47.980
﻿At first I thought he was a kind and great man...

15:48.230 --> 15:49.690
﻿But he wasn't..

15:50.990 --> 15:57.530
﻿He made me pretend to be you, and he's trying to gain all of the Preminger's fortune for himself.

15:58.030 --> 16:00.330
﻿I said I didn't want to do it though!

16:01.660 --> 16:05.830
﻿So the fact that Rosso and Bianco stole my brooch...

16:05.960 --> 16:07.420
﻿It was Herman's order.

16:07.540 --> 16:08.340
﻿How cruel!

16:10.550 --> 16:12.220
﻿I was scared!

16:12.630 --> 16:14.840
﻿So I could do nothing but obey...

16:15.470 --> 16:16.590
﻿Rosemary...

16:19.220 --> 16:20.930
﻿I'm going to get the brooch this time...

16:27.560 --> 16:29.770
﻿It's alright Rosemary.

16:30.230 --> 16:35.110
﻿I have this brooch and this dress which mother gave to me.

16:35.610 --> 16:37.570
﻿This will prove more than anything else...

16:38.990 --> 16:41.490
﻿Your mother's... dress...?

16:41.910 --> 16:46.170
﻿Yes. It came to me that day when the orphanage caught on fire...

16:46.710 --> 16:47.330
﻿Oh.

16:48.540 --> 16:52.670
﻿I'll tell the Dandelion Troupe about you and get them to protect you.

16:52.800 --> 16:55.590
﻿So don't listen to Herman anymore!

16:57.340 --> 16:58.260
﻿Okay.

16:58.550 --> 17:02.600
﻿Then I'm going to tell everybody the truth right now.

17:03.680 --> 17:05.430
﻿Come with me, Nadja.

17:08.850 --> 17:10.230
﻿I'm sorry!

17:10.650 --> 17:12.110
﻿Your precious dress!

17:12.980 --> 17:15.280
﻿What should I do...all because of me again!

17:15.700 --> 17:17.660
﻿Rosemary... it's alright...

17:17.820 --> 17:22.240
﻿No! We're going to go in front lots of people!

17:22.740 --> 17:23.490
﻿I know!

17:23.700 --> 17:26.870
﻿Take off the dress... I'll hurry and get it dried for you.

17:26.870 --> 17:27.870
﻿O-okay.

17:28.120 --> 17:29.580
﻿Then I'll get something for you to change into...

17:30.080 --> 17:30.840
﻿It's alright!

17:34.550 --> 17:36.880
﻿Wait, I'll be done soon.

17:43.930 --> 17:45.640
﻿Here we go...

17:54.480 --> 17:55.570
﻿Okay, done!

17:59.110 --> 18:00.910
﻿Thanks for this.

18:01.410 --> 18:02.240
﻿No problem.

18:08.160 --> 18:11.380
﻿I couldn't steal the brooch... but oh well.

18:20.590 --> 18:24.310
﻿Just as Keith said... Herman's the bad one.

18:25.510 --> 18:27.770
﻿He even involved my friend in all this...

18:29.140 --> 18:30.440
﻿All I want to do is...

18:31.150 --> 18:33.060
.﻿..to meet my mother...

18:33.660 --> 18:38.580
Rome

18:38.020 --> 18:38.600
﻿Collette!

18:39.280 --> 18:42.910
﻿What's the matter, honey? You sound frightened.

18:43.530 --> 18:44.120
﻿Take a look at this.

18:49.910 --> 18:51.080
﻿Nadja...

18:53.380 --> 18:55.040
﻿Collette! Are you alright?

18:56.710 --> 18:57.920
﻿She's...

18:58.880 --> 19:00.170
﻿She's alive.

19:01.880 --> 19:04.550
﻿My daughter Nadja...

19:05.260 --> 19:07.720
﻿Let's go back to Vienna first thing tomorrow morning.

19:10.390 --> 19:11.810
Yes.

19:19.530 --> 19:21.610
﻿Rosemary's late...

19:26.490 --> 19:28.790
﻿Maybe she was found by Herman and...

19:40.010 --> 19:41.590
﻿Rosemary... where are you?

19:54.190 --> 19:55.600
﻿Let go of me!

19:57.520 --> 19:58.730
﻿Just come.

19:58.730 --> 20:00.150
﻿Let go!

20:00.400 --> 20:02.240
﻿Rosemary, where are you?

20:02.490 --> 20:04.610
﻿Rosemary!!!

20:06.070 --> 20:07.620
﻿We are sorry for the inconvenience.

20:13.370 --> 20:15.170
﻿Looks like she did well.

20:17.380 --> 20:19.460
﻿If you do that again I'll call the police.

20:21.670 --> 20:24.130
﻿Please open up, my friend is in danger!

20:24.680 --> 20:27.010
﻿Rosemary will be in trouble again...

20:50.370 --> 20:52.910
﻿This is my mother's dress..

21:00.500 --> 21:01.590
﻿Rosemary!

21:02.420 --> 21:07.130
﻿Rosemary? Who are you talking about?

21:07.800 --> 21:10.760
﻿I'm the granddaughter of Duke Preminger...

21:11.430 --> 21:13.020
﻿Nadja Preminger.

21:13.930 --> 21:15.180
﻿Rosemary...!

21:15.730 --> 21:17.940
﻿You didn't even imagine this would happen did you

21:19.060 --> 21:20.730
﻿You innocent girl!

21:22.020 --> 21:23.230
﻿Stop...

21:23.400 --> 21:25.190
﻿Even if you're kind and pretty...

21:26.150 --> 21:26.700
﻿Stop...!

21:27.610 --> 21:30.070
﻿and liked by everyone...

21:31.990 --> 21:32.740
﻿Stop!!!

21:35.160 --> 21:37.120
﻿you can't live happily!

21:45.920 --> 21:50.930
﻿Goodbye... some girl from somewhere, someplace.

21:58.440 --> 22:00.020
﻿My mother's dress...

22:01.190 --> 22:04.070
﻿My mother's dress!

22:13.450 --> 22:16.660
Paris is sunnier than London

22:13.450 --> 22:16.660
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

22:16.750 --> 22:19.870
Carmen likes paella more than pasta

22:16.750 --> 22:19.870
CARUMEN men yori PAERIYA suki

22:20.330 --> 22:26.460
The Queen of Spades is a fickle person

22:20.330 --> 22:26.460
SUPEEDO no jou kimagure yasan

22:27.420 --> 22:28.630
Indeed

22:27.420 --> 22:28.630
Kitto

22:31.390 --> 22:33.800
It's not use worrying about it

22:31.390 --> 22:33.800
Nayan datte MUDA yo

22:34.390 --> 22:37.520
Que sera sera, sera Sera

22:34.390 --> 22:37.520
KE SERA SERA SERA SERA

22:37.810 --> 22:42.560
Tomorrow's going to be whatever it was meant

22:37.810 --> 22:42.560
Ashita nante itsumo naru you ni

22:42.610 --> 22:44.020
To be, to be

22:42.610 --> 22:44.020
Naru naru

22:44.320 --> 22:49.360
The tree fog won

22:44.320 --> 22:49.360
Sekai KAERU tobi KONKUURU

22:49.780 --> 22:53.740
The world frog-jumping contest

22:49.780 --> 22:53.740
Yuushou shita yo AMAGAERU

22:56.950 --> 23:03.080
Under the kitten's paw

22:56.950 --> 23:03.080
Koneko chan no ashi no ura wa

23:03.540 --> 23:09.670
Is the scent of the sun, right?

23:03.540 --> 23:09.670
Otentou sama no nioi dane

23:12.550 --> 23:15.850
Paris is sunnier than London

23:12.550 --> 23:15.850
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

23:15.970 --> 23:18.930
Carmen likes paella more than pasta

23:15.970 --> 23:18.930
CARUMEN men yori PAERIYA suki

23:19.430 --> 23:25.810
It's not the time to hang around

23:19.430 --> 23:25.810
Michikusa shite iru baai ja nai ne

23:26.730 --> 23:31.200
Indeed, indeed

23:26.730 --> 23:31.200
Kitto kitto

23:40.580 --> 23:41.680
Tomorrow's Nadja

23:41.870 --> 23:46.540
The person I met in Rome... she felt warm and smelt very nice.

23:47.750 --> 23:50.920
Hey... I'm here! Not that girl!

23:51.420 --> 23:54.640
﻿Why can't you hear me... when you're right in front of me?

23:55.050 --> 23:57.240
﻿Wait... Wait!

23:57.240 --> 23:58.830
Don't, Rosemary!

23:58.830 --> 23:59.680
﻿Give her back!

23:59.770 --> 24:02.000
Give back my Mother!

24:02.710 --> 24:04.000
Tomorrow's Nadja.

24:02.730 --> 24:05.690
Don't Steal Her-- My Mother!

24:05.440 --> 24:07.460
Now, the door of destiny opens.
